## 题面组件（widget）怎么解析内容

每个字段的 **`component`** 决定控件类型；题面值来自 **payload → displayValues**：

```6:24:frontend/src/components/workbench/shared/schema-data/build-schema-display-values.ts
export function buildSchemaDisplayValues(schema: FormSchema, data: Record<string, unknown>) {
  let values: Record<string, unknown> = { ...data };
  for (const section of schema.sections) {
    for (const field of section.fields) {
      const binding = getFieldBinding(field);
      if (binding && binding in data) {
        values = setValueAtPath(values, binding, data[binding]);
      }
    }
  }
  return values;
}
```

`renderFormField` → `FieldControlRenderer` → 例如 **`showItem`**：

```225:256:frontend/src/low-code/components/fields/show-item-utils.ts
export function resolveShowItemRawContent(field, options) {
  const source = resolveShowItemContentSource(field); // payload | static | template
  if (source === "static") return field.showItem?.staticContent ?? "";
  if (source === "template") {
    return interpolateShowItemTemplate(field.showItem?.templateContent ?? "", context);
  }
  // payload：用 path/key 从 boundValue / context 取值
}
```

`ShowItemFieldControl` 再按 `renderAs`（text / markdown / json / html）和 `layout`（inline / card / pre / table）渲染。你截图里大段「偏好对比标注」说明，典型是 **`showItem` + `static` 或 `markdown/html`**，或 **`contentSource: "payload"`** 绑定到导入列。

其它题面 widget 同理：`showImage`、`showFile`、`showVideo`、只读的 `text`/`textarea`（`importRole: display`）等。

